        "Description": "The secret loan deal was prevented. The government is now in great financial trouble, the closest counselor of the PM had to go to a secret medical facility to steady his nerves. This is a great opportunity to take him out. You will also have to take out the US head of his consultation company, and his helicopter pilot, who provides contacts for the ministers for their money laundering operations abroad. \r\rYou were the first spark, and now the fire is inevitable. No going back now, 47.",
